    technique: "With --pid=host: ls /proc/1/root/ (PID 1 is the host's init, /proc/1/root is the host's /). CAP_SYS_PTRACE or same UID needed to access another process's /proc/pid/root.",
    mitigation: "Don't use --pid=host. Drop CAP_SYS_PTRACE."
