    technique: "1. Attacker creates a container with a modified entrypoint\n2. On next 'docker exec', runc enters the container's mount namespace\n3. The container process opens /proc/self/exe (which points to the host's runc binary)\n4. Writes a malicious payload to it, overwriting runc on the host\n5. Next container operation runs the attacker's runc",
